  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nIsla de la Muerte is an intense survival game filled with mystery and danger. Stranded on a remote island, you uncover the aftermath of a secret government experiment gone horribly wrong. Officially erased from records, the island is now overrun by hordes of relentless zombies.<p></p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Survive the island: Manage hunger, thirst, and health while looting houses for supplies.\n</li><li>Explore &amp; stay alert: Search the forest and river, but beware—zombies lurk near buildings and attack on sight.\n</li><li>Build &amp; shelter: Construct your own base to stay safe from the undead.\n</li><li>Hunt &amp; gather: Hunt animals, fish in the river, and gather resources to survive.\n</li><li>Craft &amp; defend: Make weapons, traps, and barricades to fight off zombies.\n</li><li>Day &amp; night challenge: Darkness brings more danger—prepare wisely!\n</li></ul>\n",
